        ("/**\n     * Returns size of arrays specified by JSONPath.\n     * Compatible only with enhanced syntax starting with '$' character.\n     *\n     * @param path JSON path\n     * @return list of arrays size\n     */", '/**\n     * Returns size of arrays specified by JSONPath.\n     * 仅兼容以 {@code $} 开头的增强 JSONPath 语法。\n     *\n     * @param path JSON 路径\n     * @return list of arrays size\n     */'),
